Two of the three kinds are wired — `raise_or_warn_env`\n(`config.py:389,391`) and `raise_or_warn_cfg_key` (`_config_schema.py:37,766`).\n\nThe third is not. `raise_or_warn_file` (`_deprecations.py:290`) has ZERO callers anywhere,\nincluding tests. Instead `config.py:392-394` hand-rolls the raise for the single registered file\ntombstone, ignoring the row's `behavior` field entirely.\n\nThis is currently invisible because the one registered file entry (`.rebar/config.conf`,\n`_deprecations.py:228`) carries behavior `error` and the hand-rolled code raises — so the bypass\nand the registry agree by coincidence. It breaks the moment a file entry is added with behavior\n`warn`, or the existing one is downgraded: the registry would say one thing and the code do another.\n\n`docs/config.md` promises the `error` class \"raises a targeted migration error and exits\nnon-zero\". Today that promise holds only by that coincidence, and only `rebar config validate`\nreports file tombstones at all.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n\n- [x] `config.py` calls `raise_or_warn_file` instead of hand-rolling the raise\n- [x] The registry row's `behavior` field decides the outcome\n- [x] A test covers a `warn`-class file tombstone, which today has no coverage","env_id":"ade0f2ef-51cc-45a2-bb97-c09846cd3df5","file_impact":[],"file_impact_scope":"undeclared","keyring":[],"last_status_env_id":"ade0f2ef-51cc-45a2-bb97-c09846cd3df5","managed_refs":[["parent","b5bc-f4f7-3433-4181"],["relates_to","ab3a-ef74-3bd8-41ae"]],"no_file_impact_reason":"","parent_id":"b5bc-f4f7-3433-4181","parent_status_uuid":"5bee8b94-092e-49e1-b16d-5eb59d7133e9","plan_review_phase":"execution","preconditions_summary":{"status":"pre-manifest"},"priority":3,"reverts":[],"status":"in_progress","tags":["janitor"],"ticket_id":"d064-1660-c088-4a75","ticket_type":"bug","title":"Honour the deprecation registry's behavior field for file tombstones","verify_commands":[]},"source_event_uuids":["df4c3a58-101d-457c-aada-41e63c6d298c","5bee8b94-092e-49e1-b16d-5eb59d7133e9","f2688db4-0df9-43e8-86ff-67e5b61fb9c8","9ec7dc9d-a7c7-450f-92f2-6b1da364dda8","a0497576-0074-4397-9ae1-aef88526bc70","4fcae023-500e-46b8-9e57-c3ac6aac970b"]},"env_id":"ade0f2ef-51cc-45a2-bb97-c09846cd3df5","event_type":"SNAPSHOT","timestamp":1786075913113107002,"uuid":"ea1f246c-3cd0-42e2-87b6-a9957a478d36"}